{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27145","headline":"忆浔阳旧居兼感长孙郎中 · 周贺","name":"忆浔阳旧居兼感长孙郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浔阳却到是何日，此地今无旧使君。\n长忆穷冬宿庐岳，瀑泉冰折共僧闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}